<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="h-full" data-kt-theme="true" data-kt-theme-mode="light" dir="ltr" lang="fr">
<head>
    {% include 'partials/head.html.twig' %}
    <title>Page Non Trouvée (404) &bull; MCI e-Circuit</title>
</head>
<body class="antialiased flex min-h-screen bg-slate-50 text-foreground items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="max-w-lg w-full bg-background border border-border/80 shadow-md rounded-2xl p-8 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
        <!-- Logo / Armoiries -->
        <img src="{{ asset('assets/images/mci-logo.webp') }}" alt="MCI" class="size-16 object-contain mb-4"/>
        
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-primary/10 text-primary border border-primary/20 mb-3">
            <i class="ki-filled ki-information-2 text-sm"></i>
            <span>Erreur 404 &bull; Ressource Introuvable</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-foreground tracking-tight mb-2">
            Page ou Document Introuvable
        </h1>

        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Le dossier, le courrier ou la page demandée n'existe pas ou a été déplacé. Vérifiez la référence administrative saisie dans le moteur de recherche ministériel.
        </p>

        <div class="w-full p-3 rounded-lg bg-secondary/30 border border-border/60 text-start text-[11px] text-muted-foreground mb-6 space-y-1">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Code d'erreur :</span>
                <span class="font-mono">HTTP 404 NOT FOUND</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">Conseil :</span>
                <span>Utilisez la recherche multicritère par référence unique</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 w-full">
            <a href="{{ path('app_dashboard') }}" class="kt-btn kt-btn-primary kt-btn-sm w-full justify-center">
                <i class="ki-filled ki-home text-xs me-1"></i>
                <span>Tableau de bord</span>
            </a>
            <a href="{{ path('search_index') }}" class="kt-btn kt-btn-outline kt-btn-sm w-full justify-center">
                <i class="ki-filled ki-magnifier text-xs me-1"></i>
                <span>Recherche</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

